# Both images build with the repository root as context (see
# apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile), so this file serves both.
#
# node_modules and dist above all: a host-built node_modules carries Windows or
# x86 binaries (Prisma engines, esbuild) that would shadow the ones `npm ci`
# installs for linux/arm64 inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
storage
coverage
tests
apps/api/tests
**/*.log
.vite
